<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
        <%- include('partials/flash') %>

            <main class="container">
                <section class="about-hero">
                    <!-- <div class="cyber-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> EST. PLATO ARENA</div> -->
                    <h1 class="about-glitch-title"><span class="glitch-title" data-text="THE ATX STORY"
                            style="font-size: 1.5rem;">THE ATX
                            STORY</span></h1>
                    <p class="about-subtitle">Arena Team Xtreme: More than a team, a gaming family.</p>
                </section>

                <div class="about-grid">
                    <!-- Card 1: Origins -->
                    <article class="cyber-card story-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-tag">ORIGINS</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chess-knight card-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>Forged in Werewolf</h2>
                        <p>
                            <strong>ATX (Arena Team Xtreme)</strong> is more than just a group on Plato. It is a
                            bond that grew through <span>Werewolf</span> and slowly turned into something much
                            deeper than a gaming team.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            From the beginning, ATX was built around WW, bringing together players who enjoyed
                            strategy, smart thinking, and reading each other's moves. Over time, those matches
                            created trust, understanding, and real connections.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Card 2: Core Values -->
                    <article class="cyber-card story-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-tag">CODE & ETHOS</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake card-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>Beyond Victory</h2>
                        <p>
                            In ATX, the focus is not only on winning. It is about standing together in every round,
                            supporting each other's decisions, and learning from mistakes as a team.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Even when games get intense and emotions rise, <strong>respect never fades</strong>.
                            Small misunderstandings happen, but they are resolved with maturity and care—that is
                            what makes the group strong.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Card 3: Culture -->
                    <article class="cyber-card story-card full-width">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-tag">COMMUNITY & CULTURE</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles card-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>A Culture of Appreciation</h2>
                        <p>
                            One beautiful thing about ATX is the culture of appreciation. Members notice effort,
                            encourage improvement, and celebrate each other's growth. No one feels small, and
                            everyone gets a chance to shine.
                        </p>
                        <div class="feature-pills">
                            <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i> Events & Tournaments</span>
                            <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad"></i> Game Nights</span>
                            <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i> Unbreakable Loyalty</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            Events, friendly competitions, and random game nights have created countless memories
                            filled with laughter and excitement.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Dedicated Community Appreciation Section -->
                    <div class="community-tribute full-width">
                        <div class="tribute-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown"></i>You Know What!</div>
                        <p class="tribute-lead">
                            ATX Family is an elite competitive digital arena and community hub.
                        </p>
                        <p class="tribute-body">
                            To every member, admin, <span>Pro</span> and <span>Nab</span> who makes this community
                            legendary — <strong>We couldn't do it without you.</strong>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Manifesto Banner -->
                    <div class="manifesto-banner full-width">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left quote-icon"></i>
                        <blockquote class="about-quote">
                            ATX deserves appreciation because it proves that online friendships can be real and
                            meaningful. It shows that a simple WW group can grow into a family where <span>loyalty,
                                teamwork, and heart</span> matter more than the game itself.
                        </blockquote>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </main>

            <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>